{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45211","headline":"别山诗 · 皎然","name":"别山诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山翁亦好禅，借我风溪树。\n采药多近峰，汲泉有春渡。\n幽僧时相偶，仙子或与晤。\n自许战胜心，弥高独游步。\n如何区中事，夺我林栖趣。\n辞山下复上，恋石行仍顾。\n宿昔情或乖，庶几迹无误。\n松声莫相诮，此心冥去住。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}